    <string name="ui_409fee323548">"%1$s · Personal test build\n\nGoals, tasks, presets, app lists and daily focus records stay on this device. No analytics SDK or record uploads. If location is allowed, the weather service receives approximate coordinates and network request data. Location updates only while Zen is in use. Backup city mode sends the selected city’s coordinates, never goals or timer records.\n\nNo accounts, calendar access or cloud sync. Focus statistics represent timer activity only."</string>
